As a creative with a camera, the inevitable question you will be asked is &ldquo;Who is your dream client to shoot a project for?&rdquo; and for me the answer has always been the camera brand I have been holding in my hand since I was 14 years old. Younger me would have never believed that today I am sharing a campaign for the new Canon EOS R6 V 



I made a short film about @luisalkmim a parkour athlete based in Lisbon, Portugal. Before meeting Lu&iacute;s I knew very little about parkour, and watching him move around buildings like a cat completely opened my eyes to what the human body and mind is capable of. He was kind enough to let me into his world and share his incredible story with me, which I hope to do justice in this short film. Lu&iacute;s is the type of person who makes you laugh without even trying and drops the most genuine wisdom in the middle of a conversation. I can&rsquo;t wait for you to see the full film on my YouTube channel! 😍



